            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mnerney"
            },
            "reviewBody": "One of my favorite omelet recipes with lots of room for variation to keep things fresh! I tried this with egg whites for a more healthy option and used Shiitake to boost the mushroom flavor profile. Also, I really love the red pepper flakes here - they give a great 'oomph' to the taste!",
            "datePublished": "2024-02-10T05:23:45.785Z"
          },
          {
