            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "elisabeth"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've never heard of adding nutmeg to an omelet but it was delicious. Full disclosure: I only added about 1/16th of a tsp of nutmeg because I was wary it would be too overpowering and based on the results, would stick to that amount in the future. I also used baby arugula instead of spinach and feta for the cheese because that's what I had on hand.",
            "datePublished": "2017-04-03T15:01:45.387Z"
          },
