            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Laura B"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Would be much better using the whole eggs for more flavor and amount of egg to veggie ratio. Too much spices - I liked the combination, but half as much nutmeg and garlic and salt would have been better proportions. I used full fat cheese for better melting.",
